  "content": "<h2 style=\"font-size:18px;font-family:terminal,monaco,monospace;font-weight:bold\">介紹：</h2><p style=\"font-size:17px;font-family:terminal,monaco,monospace\">這個模組透過改善《Minecraft》中村莊的現有結構，使它們更有活力且值得探索，從而強化村莊的整體體驗。<br><br>更好的村莊（Better Villages）提升了村莊的整體外觀與佈局，新增了房屋的設計。本模組旨在為玩家打造更沉浸、更真實的遊戲體驗。<br><br>對於喜愛探索並與《Minecraft》中村莊互動的玩家來說，更好的村莊是一個絕佳的模組；而對於那些想為遊戲增添變化的玩家，它還提供了新的遊戲選項與挑戰。如果你想提升遊戲體驗與樂趣，更好的村莊絕對是值得一試的模組！</p><p style=\"font-size:17px;font-family:terminal,monaco,monospace\">&nbsp;</p><p style=\"font-size:17px;font-family:terminal,monaco,monospace\"><span><iframe allowfullscreen=\"allowfullscreen\" src=\"https://www.youtube.com/embed/gSdaxuLQ0Fw?wmode=transparent\" height=\"358\" width=\"638\" style=\"display:block;margin-left:auto;margin-right:auto\"></iframe></span></p><p>&nbsp;</p><h2 style=\"font-size:18px;font-family:terminal,monaco,monospace;font-weight:bold\">相容性：</h2><p style=\"font-size:17px;font-family:terminal,monaco,monospace\">本模組設計為最大相容性。然而，部分模組可能需要自己的相容包才能達到完美效果。總體而言，它應能與大多數模組正常運作，當然，少數無法預測的問題或錯誤仍有可能發生。</p><p style=\"font-size:17px;font-family:terminal,monaco,monospace\">與以下模組完美相容：</p><ul>\n<li>Repurposed Structures</li>\n<li>ChoiceTheorem's Overhauled Village</li>\n<li>Bountiful (資料包可用 <a href=\"https://legacy.curseforge.com/minecraft/texture-packs/better-villages-bountiful\" rel=\"nofollow\">點此處</a>)</li>\n<li>Ice and Fire: Dragons (資料包可用 <a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/texture-packs/better-villages-ice-and-fire-compat-datapack\" rel=\"nofollow\">點此處</a>)</li>\n<li>More Villagers (資料包可用 <a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/texture-packs/better-villages-more-villagers-compatibility\" rel=\"nofollow\">點此處</a>)</li>\n<li>Immersive Engineering (資料包可用 <a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/texture-packs/better-villages-immersive-engineering\" rel=\"nofollow\">點此處</a>)</li>\n<li>Waystones</li>\n<li>以及更多...</li>\n</ul><p>注意：未來計劃新增更多相容性，我們正積極開發中。歡迎前往我們的GitHub提交相容請求（或加入我們的Discord！）</p><p>&nbsp;</p><h2 style=\"font-size:18px;font-family:terminal,monaco,monospace;font-weight:bold\">支援的模組載入器：</h2><p style=\"font-size:17px;font-family:terminal,monaco,monospace\">我們積極支援 Forge、NeoForge 和 Fabric 模組載入器，涵蓋從 1.16.5 至最新釋出的《Minecraft》版本。在下方連結中選擇你喜好的模組載入器：</p><div>\n<div style=\"background-color:#1a1a1a;color:#e5e5e5\"><img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/jtorleon-studios-team/.github/refs/heads/main/assets/modloaders/fabric-favicon-32x32.png\" width=\"60\"> <a style=\"font-size:18px;font-family:terminal,monaco,monospace;text-decoration:none;line-height:60px;margin-left:5px\" href=\"https://curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/better-village-fabric\" rel=\"nofollow\">Fabric 版本在此 <span style=\"color:#f16436\">[點我🔗]</span></a></div>\n\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<div style=\"background-color:#1a1a1a;color:#e5e5e5\"><img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/jtorleon-studios-team/.github/refs/heads/main/assets/modloaders/neoforge-favicon-32x32.png\" width=\"60\"> <a style=\"font-size:18px;font-family:terminal,monaco,monospace;text-decoration:none;line-height:60px;margin-left:5px\" href=\"https://curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/better-village-neoforge\" rel=\"nofollow\">NeoForge 版本在此 <span style=\"color:#f16436\">[點我🔗]</span></a></div>\n</div><p>&nbsp;</p><h2 style=\"font-size:18px;font-family:terminal,monaco,monospace;font-weight:bold\">必要模組：</h2><p style=\"font-size:17px;font-family:terminal,monaco,monospace\">請務必安裝以下模組，它們是此專案正常運作並提供完整體驗的關鍵。</p><div style=\"background-color:#1a1a1a;color:#e5e5e5\"><a style=\"font-size:18px;font-family:terminal,monaco,monospace;text-decoration:none;line-height:60px;margin-left:15px\" href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/library-ferret-forge\" rel=\"nofollow\"> 📦 Library Ferret </a></div><p>&nbsp;</p><h2 style=\"font-size:18px;font-family:terminal,monaco,monospace;font-weight:bold\">連結：</h2><p style=\"font-size:17px;font-family:terminal,monaco,monospace\">尋找我們的資源並加入社群：</p><div style=\"background-color:#1a1a1a;color:#e5e5e5\"><a style=\"font-size:18px;font-family:terminal,monaco,monospace;text-decoration:none;line-height:60px;margin-left:15px\" href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fjtorleon-studios-team.github.io%252f\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"> 🔗 連結樹 </a></div><p>&nbsp;</p><div style=\"background-color:#1a1a1a;color:#e5e5e5\"><a style=\"font-size:18px;font-family:terminal,monaco,monospace;text-decoration:none;line-height:60px;margin-left:15px\" href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fjtorleon-studios-team.github.io%252fdiscord.html\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"> 🔗 Discord </a></div><p>&nbsp;</p><div style=\"background-color:#1a1a1a;color:#e5e5e5\"><a style=\"font-size:18px;font-family:terminal,monaco,monospace;text-decoration:none;line-height:60px;margin-left:15px\" href=\"https://github.com/jtorleon-studios-team\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"> 🔗 Github </a></div><p>&nbsp;</p><h2 style=\"font-size:18px;font-family:terminal,monaco,monospace;font-weight:bold\">合作夥伴：</h2><p style=\"font-size:17px;font-family:terminal,monaco,monospace\">本專案由 BisectHosting 自豪支持。查看他們的服務，以便以優質且可靠的方式輕鬆託管你的專案。</p><div style=\"background-color:#1a1a1a;color:#e5e5e5\"><a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fwww.bisecthosting.com%252fjtl\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"> <img src=\"https://www.bisecthosting.com/partners/custom-banners/789de297-fbf1-423b-aa14-990433cf8f58.webp\" alt=\"banner bisechosting\" width=\"1086\" height=\"180\"> </a></div><p>&nbsp;</p><h2 style=\"font-size:18px;font-family:terminal,monaco,monospace;font-weight:bold\">行動呼籲：</h2><p style=\"font-size:17px;font-family:terminal,monaco,monospace\">有問題嗎？需要幫助嗎？加入我們的 Discord 或造訪 GitHub，與社群互動並貢獻！</p>",
